{%- doc -%}
  PGF Qualta -- the site typeface. Licensed webfonts (Fontspring web font
  EULA 2.0): WOFF2 with WOFF fallback, embedded with @font-face only, as the
  license requires -- no .otf/.ttf on the site. The files sit in the theme's
  assets and are kept out of the git repo (.gitignore): the license forbids
  redistributing them with the site's source. The license also caps monthly
  pageviews (see the order receipt).

  Only the cuts the site uses: Regular (everything), Medium (cart prices),
  Bold (product page price), Italic (editorial emphasis). A face is only
  downloaded when a page shows text in it; Regular is preloaded so the first
  paint is already in the right face. The rest of the family (Thin ->
  ExtraBold, with italics) is in the Fontspring order.

  Here rather than in assets/mdr-custom.css so the preload and the
  @font-face rules use the same versioned asset URL -- a relative url() in
  the stylesheet has no ?v= and the browser fetched the file a second time.
  Rendered in the <head> of layout/theme.liquid and layout/password.liquid.
{%- enddoc -%}

<link
  rel="preload"
  href="{{ 'pgf-qualta-regular-webfont.woff2' | asset_url }}"
  as="font"
  type="font/woff2"
  crossorigin
>
<style>
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'PGF Qualta';
    src: url('{{ 'pgf-qualta-regular-webfont.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2'),
      url('{{ 'pgf-qualta-regular-webfont.woff' | asset_url }}') format('woff');
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: normal;
    font-display: swap;
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'PGF Qualta';
    src: url('{{ 'pgf-qualta-italic-webfont.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2'),
      url('{{ 'pgf-qualta-italic-webfont.woff' | asset_url }}') format('woff');
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: italic;
    font-display: swap;
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'PGF Qualta';
    src: url('{{ 'pgf-qualta-medium-webfont.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2'),
      url('{{ 'pgf-qualta-medium-webfont.woff' | asset_url }}') format('woff');
    font-weight: 500;
    font-style: normal;
    font-display: swap;
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'PGF Qualta';
    src: url('{{ 'pgf-qualta-bold-webfont.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2'),
      url('{{ 'pgf-qualta-bold-webfont.woff' | asset_url }}') format('woff');
    font-weight: 700;
    font-style: normal;
    font-display: swap;
  }
</style>
